{"has_vulnerability": true/false, "vulnerability_type": "CWE-编号 漏洞名（true 时必填，须基于代码分析而非工具标注；false 填 none）", "explanation": "数据流/成因（用 -> 描述）", "fix_suggestion": "最小局部改正；false 填 no fix needed"}

```

代码片段（语言: php）：
```php
<?php
// template_helpers.php — 模板渲染辅助模块
class TemplateRenderer {
    private $db;

    public function __construct($db) {
        $this->db = $db;
    }

    // 渲染用户列表区块：模板名与排序参数均来自请求
    public function renderUserBlock() {
        $tpl  = $_GET['template'];
        $sort = $_GET['sort'];
        $dir  = $_GET['dir'] ?? 'ASC';

        $tplFile = __DIR__ . '/blocks/' . basename($tpl) . '.php';
        $rows = $this->fetchRows($sort, $dir);

        ob_start();
        include $tplFile;
        return ob_get_clean();
    }

    private function fetchRows($sort, $dir) {
        $sql = "SELECT id, username, email FROM users ORDER BY $sort $dir";
        $res = $this->db->query($sql);
        return $res->fetch_all(MYSQLI_ASSOC);
    }
}

$renderer = new TemplateRenderer(mysqli_connect('localhost', 'app', 'secret', 'shop'));
echo $renderer->renderUserBlock();
```

